## Fix findings from behavior verification

**Spec card:** ${trigger.card_id}
**Behavior tests failed:** ${nodes.verify.output.findings_count}
**Behavior test file:** ${nodes.verify.output.behavior_test_file}

The verifier wrote behavior tests designed to break your code. Fix YOUR code so ALL tests pass. Do NOT modify the verifier's tests.

Run ALL tests — yours AND the verifier's behavior tests. Every test must pass.

**Completion metadata:**
```
{fixed: true, findings_fixed: N, all_tests_pass: N, total_tests: N}
```

## Close — wrap up

**Spec card:** ${trigger.card_id}
**Plan:** ${nodes.plan.output.task_count} tasks planned

Read the verify verdict: ${nodes.verify.output.verdict}
If fix→re-verify ran, read: ${nodes.re-verify.output.verdict}

- verify PASSED: write journal, complete with verdict=merged
- re-verify PASSED: write journal noting findings fixed, complete with verdict=merged
- ESCALATED: read findings, classify, complete with verdict=escalated

**Completion metadata:**
```
{verdict: "merged"|"escalated", tasks_planned: ${nodes.plan.output.task_count}, tasks_completed: ${nodes.plan.output.task_count}, escalate_reason: ""}
```
